/P 313 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
675 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 313 0 R
/E (Moreover, the project acknowledges the multifaceted nature of traffic congestion. Through the integration of advanced algorithms to estimate traffic intensity, the system not only quan- tifies traffic flow but also discerns the impact of different vehicle types on congestion dynam- ics. Beyond the immediate advantages of reducing congestion and enhancing traffic flow, the project aligns with broader goals such as economic efficiency. Implementing adaptive traf- fic light control systems holds enough ability so as to minimize fuel consumption as well as optimize the use of road infrastructure, contributing to a more streamlined and resource- effective urban transportation system..)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
