/P 327 0 R
/T (After conducting thorough research and several trial runs to determine the optimal model size for training and fine-tuning according to our specific requirements, we settled on the YOLOv8l model. This decision was guided by our need for a balanced blend of accuracy and speed. While smaller-sized models offered faster inference speeds, they often sacrificed accuracy. On the other hand, larger-sized models showed only marginal improvements in accuracy at the expense of significantly longer inference times. Therefore, in pursuit of equilibrium between speed and accuracy, we opted for the YOLOv8l model.)
/E (After conducting thorough research and several trial runs to determine the optimal model size for training and fine-tuning according to our specific requirements, we settled on the YOLOv8l model. This decision was guided by our need for a balanced blend of accuracy and speed. While smaller-sized models offered faster inference speeds, they often sacrificed accuracy. On the other hand, larger-sized models showed only marginal improvements in accuracy at the expense of significantly longer inference times. Therefore, in pursuit of equilibrium between speed and accuracy, we opted for the YOLOv8l model.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
