/E (Looking ahead, our project is set to evolve in two key directions. Firstly, we plan to enhance our smart traffic control system by incorporating features designed specifically for emer- gency vehicles. This involves optimizing traffic signals to facilitate the smooth and efficient movement of ambulances, fire trucks, and other emergency vehicles through intersections. By doing so, we aim to contribute to quicker response times during emergencies, making our system even more beneficial to the community.)
/Pg 49 0 R
/K [7]
>>
