2376 0 obj
<<
/Title (7. Mish Activation Function: YOLOv8 incorporates the Mish activation function. This activation function, known for its smoothness and non-linearity, enhances the stability of the model. It can allow the model to capture complex features effectively, contributing to the overall accuracy of vehicle detection.)
/Dest [34 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 2378 0 R
/Next 2374 0 R
>>
endobj
