2378 0 obj
<<
/Title (6. Loss Function Optimization: YOLOv8 employs a comprehensive loss function that quan- tifies the discrepancies between predicted and ground truth bounding boxes and class proba- bilities. This optimization process guides the model to adjust its parameters during training, refining its predictions for enhanced accuracy in vehicle detection.)
/Dest [34 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 2380 0 R
/Next 2376 0 R
>>
endobj
