<<
/Title (5. Anchor Boxes for Spatial Precision: Anchor boxes, predefined bounding box sizes, guide the model during training to predict accurate bounding boxes. This contributes to spatial precision in vehicle localization, ensuring the model accurately identifies the spatial extent of each detected vehicle.)
/Dest [34 0 R /Fit]
